# Introduction to Thinking Critically About AI

#### Let’s begin with the foundational structures of the Thinking Critically About AI unit. This section introduces the project-based learning model that shapes the unit, the culminating student project, and the digital tools students will use to investigate and create.

<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom:0px">
    <div style="width: 70%;">
        <p style="line-height: 1.5; font-size: 18px;">
            In this section, you will:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
            <li style="line-height: 1.5;font-size: 18px;">
                Describe how Project-Based Learning (PBL) structures — such as driving questions, milestones, critique, and public product — shape the flow of the unit
            </li>
            <li style="line-height: 1.5;font-size: 18px;">
               Identify the purpose and expectations of the culminating unit project
            </li>
            <li style="line-height: 1.5;font-size: 18px;">
				Explore the digital lab environments students will use throughout the unit
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: black;">
